    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\nCanceling the command line emits an empty message and leaves `msg_ext_fast` false. With `msg.targets = 'msg'`, the next prompt's text reaches the message handler before `cmdline_show` and appears in the message window instead of the dialog.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nFlush pending messages, then scope the non-fast override to the empty event. Restore the previous context so empty chunks inside `:echo` or `nvim_echo()` do not change their enclosing message's callback context.\r\n\r\nFixes #42154.\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\n- The new screen regression fails on master (`cc4e0c8d60`) and passes with the fix\r\n- `messages2_spec.lua`: 34 passed\r\n- `messages_spec.lua`: 86 passed, 1 platform skip; 1 socket-dependent test excluded because this sandbox disallows Unix sockets\r\n- `cmdline_spec.lua`: 72 passed\r\n- Debug build, StyLua, C lint, commit lint, and `git diff --check` pass\r\n\r\nTests used stdio RPC with only the harness's optional test-ID listener suppressed.\r\n\r\nAI-assisted.",
